<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

You hand over the money. <<He>> counts it and puts it away.
<br><br>

<<if $worn.neck.name is "Whitney's collar" or $worn.neck.name is "Whitney's collar with leash">>
	<<His>> eyes drop to your neck.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> takes your jaw in one hand and tilts your head to get a better look at Whitney's collar. The corner of <<his>> mouth lifts.
	<br><br>

	"Whitney can pretend all <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> likes," <<he>> says. "But <<nnpc_he "Whitney">> knows who you belong to."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> produces a pair of bolt cutters from <<his>> desk drawer. The collar comes off in one clean cut. <<He>> drops it in the bin.
	<br><br>
	<<set $worn.neck.type.push("broken")>>
	<<neckruined>>

<<elseif $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1>>
	<<His>> eyes drop to your neck. <<He>> goes still at the sight of your collar. The heart glows a dim green, reflected in <<his>> eyes as <<he>> runs a finger along the length of it. <<His>> touch is warm. You shiver.
	<br><br>

	"That witch marked you." <<He>> doesn't try to remove it. <<He>> knows what it is.
	<br><br>

	Instead, <<he>> opens <<his>> desk drawer and reaches deep in the back of it. <<He>> produces a tuning fork.
	<br><br>

	"This is going to hurt," <<he>> says. <<He>> hits the tuning fork against <<his>> desk and brings it slowly towards the heart of your collar.
	<br><br>

	<<pass 5>>The tuning fork touches the heart. The heart seems to scream. Your neck burns. Your vision blurs.<<gpain>><<pain 6>><<gstress>><<stress 8>><<gwylanHypnosis "devotion" -15>>
	<br><br>

	The heart turns blood red. The collar unlatches from your neck, into Bailey's hands.
	<br><br>

	<<set $worn.neck.cursed to 0>>
	<<set $worn.neck.type.push("broken")>>
	<<neckruined>>
	<<He>> tosses it in the wastebin.
	<br><br>

<<elseif $worn.neck.name isnot "naked">>
	<<His>> eyes drop to your neck and the $worn.neck.name you have on. <<He>> tugs it off and drops it in <<his>> wastebin without a second thought.
	<br><br>
	<<set $worn.neck.type.push("broken")>>
	<<neckruined>>
<</if>>

<<He>> reaches into <<his>> jacket and produces another lotus collar.
<br><br>

<<He>> beckons you forward with a finger and you bow down to help <<him>> put the lotus collar on you.

"Don't lose it again," <<he>> says.
<br><br>

The lotus sits at the hollow of your neck.
<br><br>

<<set _collarIdx to setup.clothes.neck.findIndex(function(item) { return item.name === "Bailey's collar"; })>><<if _collarIdx gte 0>><<neckwear _collarIdx>><</if>>
<<set $bailey_collar_taken to false>>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Bailey Collar Police Release
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   Police release. Included from the Police Cell when the
   officer notices Bailey's collar. He radios it in and lets PC go.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>>

The radio buzzes one final time and the officer's posture changes. <<He>> stands a little straighter.
<br><br>

"Right," <<he>> says into the radio. <<He>> clips it back to <<his>> belt and turns to you.
<br><br>

"You're leaving." <<He>> unlocks the cell door and gestures toward the exit. "Get out of here before I change my mind."
<br><br>

<<crimeClear "all">>
<<link [[Next|Police Station]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
:: Maths Abduction Demand
<<effects>><<set $location to "moor">>
/* Do NOT call npc Bailey here. The buyer (person2) and goons (person3-5) from
   Maths Abduction 4's generate2/3/4/5 are still in $NPCList, and calling
   npc Name on slot 0 while $enemyno >= 1 auto-fires endevent, which wipes
   every slot. Bailey is already in slot 0, so person1 alone sets his pronouns. */
/* From DNA: even if macro inside comment, it can still being read by twine */
<<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	You wince at the money in Bailey's hands. "Y-You can get more out of me, right?"
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	You glare at the money in Bailey's hands. "That's all? I'm insulted. You're owed more than that."
<<else>>
	You look at the money in Bailey's hands. "I'm worth more than that."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person2>>The <<person>> scoffs. "You don't get to—"
<br><br>

<<person1>>Bailey silences <<him>> with a look.
<br><br>

<<person1>>Bailey glances sideways at you before opening the trapdoor once again. <<He>> takes the whole rucksack without counting, this time.<<npcincr Bailey dom 1>><<set $bailey_dom += 1>><<gdom "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
<br><br>

"Pleasure," <<he>> says to the <<person2>><<person>>.
<br><br>

<<link [[Continue (0:30)|Maths Abduction 6]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Avery Cards Bailey Drive Home
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<<if $bailey_love gte 30>>
	Bailey takes a route you've never seen <<him>> take. The streets are empty at this hour, the city reduced to amber streetlight and wet asphalt. Through the vents comes the faint salt smell of the ocean. At a red light <<he>> turns and looks at you. <<His>> eyes move over your face like <<hes>> reading you.
	<br><br>

	<<if $bailey_dom gte 70>>
		<<He>> seems to reach a decision. <<He>> reaches over, takes your jaw in one hand, and kisses you.<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">><<npcincr Bailey lust 1>><<glust "Bailey">><<if $player.virginity.kiss is true>><br><br><<if $stockholm_bailey gte 3>><span class="pink">You feel elated having Bailey take your first kiss.</span><<arousal 500>><<garousal>><<else>><span class="red">You feel mortified having Bailey take your first kiss.</span><<arousal 100>><<garousal>><<stress 6>><<gstress>><<trauma 6>><<gtrauma>><</if>><<takeVirginity "Bailey" "kiss">><</if>>
		<br><br>

		The light changes. <<He>> lets go. <<He>> faces forward and drives.
		<br><br>

		The city slides past the window and <<his>> hands stay on the wheel. The only sound is the engine and the road. <<He>> drives like nothing happened at all. <<He>> doesn't look at you again.
	<<else>>
		The light changes. <<He>> faces forward and drives. Neither of you speak the whole way home.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	The drive is short. Bailey takes the direct route and doesn't look at you once. You arrive before you expected to.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person1>>Bailey parks and escorts you inside the orphanage without a word.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<avery_cards_end>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Bailey Town Reaction [widget]
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   TOWN PROJECT REACTIONS  (widget baileyTownReaction)
   Called from Bailey's office passage. On about 1 visit in 3,
   if a town project PC funded is built ($town_projects.X >= 3) and Bailey
   hasn't mentioned it yet, he comments on one of them. With Stockholm >= 2
   the comment is warmer. One reaction per visit.
   Seen flags live in $bailey_town: .bridge, .road, .diving, .thicket, .green
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<widget "baileyTownReaction">>
<<if $town_projects isnot undefined>>
<<if $bailey_town is undefined>><<set $bailey_town to {}>><</if>>
<<rng>>
<<if $rng lte 33>>
	<<set _projects to []>>
	<<if $town_projects.bridge gte 3 and !$bailey_town.bridge>><<run _projects.push("bridge")>><</if>>
	<<if $town_projects.road gte 3 and !$bailey_town.road>><<run _projects.push("road")>><</if>>
	<<if $town_projects.diving gte 3 and !$bailey_town.diving>><<run _projects.push("diving")>><</if>>
	<<if $town_projects.thicket gte 3 and !$bailey_town.thicket>><<run _projects.push("thicket")>><</if>>
	<<if $town_projects.green gte 3 and !$bailey_town.green>><<run _projects.push("green")>><</if>>

	<<if _projects.length gt 0>>
		<<set _pick to _projects[random(0, _projects.length - 1)]>>
		<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

		<<if _pick is "bridge">>
			<<set $bailey_town.bridge to true>>
			"They rebuilt the bridge on Barb Street." <<He>> doesn't look up from <<his>> paperwork. "That was you."
			<br><br>
			<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 2>>
				<<He>> nods sharply. "Good. The orphanage is safer for it."
			<<else>>
				<<He>> glances at you. "You still owe me rent."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif _pick is "road">>
			<<set $bailey_town.road to true>>
			"The road to the lake." <<He>> folds <<his>> arms. "That was your little project."
			<br><br>
			<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 2>>
				<<He>> closes a folder. "The town talks."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
			<<else>>
				"Don't forget about rent," <<he>> says.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif _pick is "diving">>
			<<set $bailey_town.diving to true>>
			<<He>> sets down <<his>> pen. "Fifty thousand pounds." <<He>> looks at you. "For an office to fish for junk at the bottom of a lake."
			<br><br>
			<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 2>>
				"You're building something." <<He>> picks <<his>> pen back up. "Don't let it distract you from what you owe."<<npcincr Bailey love 2>><<set $bailey_love += 2>><<glove "Bailey">>
			<<else>>
				"Fifty thousand pounds," <<he>> repeats. "And I have to chase you for your dues."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif _pick is "thicket">>
			<<set $bailey_town.thicket to true>>
			"Someone cleaned up that mess in the residential district." <<He>> glances at you. "You."
			<br><br>
			<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 2>>
				<<He>> goes back to <<his>> work. "Decent investment."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
			<<else>>
				<<He>> goes back to <<his>> work. "Waste of money."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<<elseif _pick is "green">>
			<<set $bailey_town.green to true>>
			"The school called." <<He>> taps <<his>> pen against the desk. "They mentioned you cleared the green."
			<br><br>
			<<if $stockholm_bailey gte 2>>
				"Good," <<he>> says. "Makes it less of an eyesore."<<npcincr Bailey love 1>><<set $bailey_love += 1>><<glove "Bailey">>
			<<else>>
				<<He>> dismisses you. "Rent's still due."
			<</if>>
			<br><br>

		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<</widget>>


:: Skyscraper Save Bailey
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER SAVE PATH (Stockholm variant)
   Replaces Skyscraper Save Rescue 3 when $stockholm_bailey >= 2. Bailey
   comes to PC on the curb; Robin is there because Bailey brought him.
   Rejoins vanilla at Skyscraper Save 4.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>><<unset $fire>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

Your lungs hungrily take in fresh air, although it's still marred with the stench of flame. Avery coughs, and you sit each other down on the curb.
<br><br>

A shadow falls over you. Bailey stands there, coat dusted with ash. <<He>> looks you over with calm assessment.
<br><br>

"You're not hurt," <<he>> says, like <<he>> already checked.
<br><br>

<<if $robinSeen.includes("avery_skyscraper_rescue")>>
	<<npc Robin 3>>
	Robin runs up behind <<him>>, as if <<person3>><<hes>> about to push past Bailey to reach you. <<He>> hesitates there, giving Avery a wary glance, which only prompts <<person1>><<him>> to weakly nod.
	<br><br>

	<<person3>>Robin wraps <<his>> arms around you. "I saw the firefighters, and, and—" <<He>> starts to choke up. "I couldn't stop myself. I just ran in."
	<br><br>

	<<Hes>> pulled away by a firefighter. "Alright, hero, give them some breathing room." <<He>> stubbornly clings to you for another moment, but relents.
	<br><br>

	"I'll see you at h—" <<he>> stops <<himself>>, looking at Avery. <<He>> closes <<his>> eyes, and yells. "I'll see you at home!" <<He>> wears a hopeful smile. It looks like <<hes>> staying to help.<<npcincr Robin dom 10>><<ggdom "Robin">>
	<br><br>

	<<person1>>Bailey watches Robin go. <<He>> doesn't comment.
<<elseif C.npc.Sirris.state is "active">>
	<<npc Sirris 3>>
	Sirris walks up. "Sydney will be happy that you're alright." <<person3>><<He>> kneels down, and ruffles your hair. "And how are you, Avery?"
	<br><br>

	Avery only huffs in response, prompting Sirris to frown. "I saw the blaze from home. I was only coming to make sure the shop was alright, but then I heard in passing that you were inside."
	<br><br>

	<<He>> scoffs. "Fire crew needed a little kick in the pants to get moving." <<He>> stands. "Get this prick to the hospital in one piece for me, alright? I'll see you at school." <<He>> mutters something else under <<his>> breath, along the lines of something being 'too good for Avery.'
<</if>>
<br><br>

The sounds of chaos surround you, the rhythm of the sirens assailing your mind, keeping it alert through the exhaustion creeping over you.
Avery sighs deeply. You take one last look towards the building.
<<if $brownFoxRevealed>>
	<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
		<span class="purple">Nobody emerges. Nobody smiles at you one last time before vanishing into the night.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<summon_brown_fox 2>>
		<span class="green">You see the <<say_brown_fox>> emerge,</span> <<person2>><<his>> cloak now lightly burnt. <<He>> smiles and nods at you, before vanishing into the night.
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You never saw <<say_brown_fox>> leave.</span>
<</if>>
<<person1>>
You help Avery stand. Bailey is already walking back towards <<his>> car.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Skyscraper Save 4]]>><</link>>
<br><br>


:: Skyscraper Run Rescue Bailey
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 1: Rescue
   Replaces Skyscraper Run Rescue 2 when $stockholm_bailey >= 2. Bailey axes
   through, catches PC, and lifts them. Leads to a Carry/Struggle choice.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>><<set $fire to 2>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<npc Bailey>><<npc Robin 2>><<summon_brown_fox 5>><<person1>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	You open your mouth to call out for help, and get a lungful of fresh smoke. You cough.
	<br><br>

	<<if !$avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
		"Save your breath." <<say_brown_fox "cap">> pulls off <<person5>><<his>> cloak, and wraps it around your mouths. "Come on, push."
	<</if>>
	The two of you push against the debris. <span class="red">It barely moves.</span>
<<else>>
	You waste no time, moving to the edge of the debris and pushing<<if !$avery_mansion.fox.nobody>> alongside <<say_brown_fox>><</if>>. <span class="red">It barely moves.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<set $robinSeen.pushUnique("avery_skyscraper_rescue")>>
Before you can think about a different way out, some of it moves out of place from the other side.<br>
<<person2>>"I found <<phim>>! <<pShes>> here!" <span class="green">It sounds like Robin.</span>
<br><br>

<<person1>>"Move." <span class="bailey-red">You know that voice.</span> The head of an axe crashes through the debris.
<br><br>

All together, you make the debris wall yield.
<br><br>

You collapse forward. Bailey catches you by the arm. <<He>> lifts you easily.
<br><br>

<<link [[Let Bailey carry you|Skyscraper Run Bailey Carry]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Struggle to your feet|Skyscraper Run Bailey Struggle]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey Carry
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 2: Carry
   Bailey carries PC down the stairs; Robin follows behind.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>><<unset $fire>>
<<npc Bailey>><<npc Robin 2>><<summon_brown_fox 5>><<person1>>

Bailey carries you down the stairs. You bounce against <<his>> chest as <<he>> takes them two at a time. You look back.
<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
	<span class="purple">Nobody is right behind you.</span> <<person2>>Robin hovers behind you, <<his>> eyes never leaving you.
<<elseif $brownFoxRevealed>>
	<<say_brown_fox "cap">> is right behind you. <<person2>>Robin hovers behind as well, <<his>> eyes never leaving you.
<<else>>
	<<person2>>Robin hovers behind, <<his>> eyes never leaving you. <span class="red">You don't see <<say_brown_fox>>.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person1>>
The smoke thins, but you can't stop coughing. Bailey reaches the bottom of the stairwell and enters the large room where the function was held. Firefighters are already here, helping the injured escape. <<if $exposed gte 1>>One hands you towels as you pass.<<towelup>> Bailey doesn't stop.<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey exits the building. Above you, the fire roars against the sky. The top half of the building looks engulfed, and it's spreading.
<br><br>

<<He>> carries you to <<his>> car and sets you down against it. <<He>> seems immune to the pandemonium, though <<his>> knuckles are bleeding.
<br><br>

<<link [[Get in|Skyscraper Run Bailey 3]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
	<<link [[Tell <<him>> to wait for nobody|Skyscraper Run Bailey Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif !$brownFoxRevealed>>
	<<link [[Tell <<him>> to wait for the brown fox|Skyscraper Run Bailey Wait]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey Struggle
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 3: Struggle
   PC gets up on their own; Bailey supports them and Robin follows behind.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>><<set $outside to 1>><<unset $fire>>
<<npc Bailey>><<npc Robin 2>><<summon_brown_fox 5>><<person1>>

You struggle to your feet. Bailey grabs your arm and pulls it over <<his>> shoulder. <<He>> keeps one hand on your waist as you continue the journey down the stairwell. You look back.
<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
	<span class="purple">Nobody is right behind you.</span> <<person2>>Robin hovers behind you, <<his>> eyes never leaving you.
<<elseif $brownFoxRevealed>>
	<<say_brown_fox "cap">> is right behind you. <<person2>>Robin hovers behind as well, <<his>> eyes never leaving you.
<<else>>
	<<person2>>Robin hovers behind, <<his>> eyes never leaving you. <span class="red">You don't see <<say_brown_fox>>.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<person1>>
The smoke thins, but you can't stop coughing. You try to keep your focus on your footing. Bailey doesn't slow down. You reach the bottom of the stairwell and enter the large room where the function was held. Firefighters are already here, helping the injured escape. <<if $exposed gte 1>>One hands you towels as you pass.<<towelup>><</if>>
<br><br>

You reach the cool night air and spare a glance at the building behind you. The top half is in flames, and it's spreading.
<br><br>

Bailey walks you to <<his>> car and leans you against it. <<He>> seems immune to the pandemonium, though <<his>> knuckles are bleeding.
<br><br>

<<link [[Get in|Skyscraper Run Bailey 3]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
	<<link [[Tell <<him>> to wait for nobody|Skyscraper Run Bailey Wait]]>><</link>>
<<elseif !$brownFoxRevealed>>
	<<link [[Tell <<him>> to wait for the brown fox|Skyscraper Run Bailey Wait]]>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey Wait
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Wait for the fox
   Same as vanilla Run Wait, except Robin is present.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>><<npc Robin 2>><<summon_brown_fox 5>>
<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
	You tell Bailey to wait for nobody.
	<br><br>

	<<He>> puts a hand on <<his>> head, as if <<he>> suddenly had a headache.
	<br><br>

	<<person2>>Robin looks nauseous, but shakes it off. <<grtrauma>>
<<else>>
	<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
		"M-my—" you cough. "My friend is still in there."
	<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
		"Wait, wait! What about the fox?"
	<<else>>
		"Why didn't you pull <<person5>><<him>> out with me?"
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<person2>>Robin gives you a confused look. "Who are you talking about? There wasn't anyone else trapped in there with you."
	<br><br>

	<<person1>>Bailey scoffs.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Get in|Skyscraper Run Bailey 3]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey 3
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 4: Car
   Robin gets in beside PC. Keeps the vanilla Robin-trauma and fox lines,
   plus the detour to Avery's mansion.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "danube">><<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<npc Bailey>><<npc Robin 2>><<summon_brown_fox 5>>
Robin climbs into the back of Bailey's car and pulls you in beside <<him>>.
<<if _robin.trauma gte 20>>
	<<He>> says nothing, and the way the fire dances in <<his>> eyes is terrifying. You've not seen <<him>> like this before.<<gggdom Robin>><<npcincr Robin dom 15>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> takes your hand, and smiles at you. The fire dancing in <<his>> eyes feels appropriate. You've not seen <<him>> like this before.<<gggdom Robin>><<npcincr Robin dom 15>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $brownFoxRevealed and !$avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
	<<say_brown_fox "cap">> hops into the front passenger seat and adjusts <<person5>><<his>> mask. Bailey glares at <<him>>. "I didn't offer you a ride."
	<br><br>

	<<say_brown_fox "cap">> smiles back at <<person1>><<him>>. "I didn't ask for one, yet here we are." Bailey simply glares at <<person5>><<him>>, but doesn't protest further.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<person1>>
Bailey wears a small smile as <<he>> drives. "We're taking a detour."
<br><br>
You arrive at Danube Street. Bailey veers off, onto the boulevard, towards Avery's mansion. There are cars parked outside. One of <<his>> goons leans on one, and another loads a boot with a pile of books. Bailey pulls to a stop, and opens the window as the first goon approaches.
<br><br>
<<generate3>>"Great haul," <<person3>><<he>> says, excited. "We've rigged the place. Just need your confirmation."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Skyscraper Run Bailey 4]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey 4
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 5: Detonator
   Same as vanilla Run 4, with an added "You earned this." All options
   kept, including Let Robin.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<set $outside to 1>>
<<person1>>
Bailey climbs from the car, and gestures for
<<if $brownFoxRevealed and !$avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
	you, Robin and <<say_brown_fox>>
<<else>>
	you and Robin
<</if>>
to do likewise. You step through Avery's gates. More of Bailey's goons are here. Having a smoke, chatting, giving the mansion proper a wide berth.
<br><br>

One of the goons hands Bailey a remote, then hides behind a statue. Bailey considers a moment, then holds the device out to you. There's a single red button on it.
<br><br>

<span class="bailey-red">"You earned this."</span>
<br><br>

<<link [[Tell Bailey you have an expensive wardrobe inside|Skyscraper Run Wardrobe]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Destroy Avery's mansion|Skyscraper Run Destroy]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Let Bailey do it|Skyscraper Run Let]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Let Robin do it|Skyscraper Run Let Robin]]>><<npcincr Robin dom 5>><</link>><<gdom "Robin">>
<br>
<<if $brownFoxRevealed>>
	<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
		<<link [[Let nobody do it|Skyscraper Run Let Fox]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Let <<say_brown_fox>> do it|Skyscraper Run Let Fox]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey 5
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 6: After the explosion
   Robin is dismissed as in vanilla; only the link destinations differ.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>><<set $outside to 0>>
<<set _robin to statusCheck("Robin")>>
<<person2>>
You climb into Bailey's car. Robin tries to follow, but Bailey catches <<his>> shoulder. "You're injured." Robin examines <<his>> arm, as if it were news to <<him>>.
<br><br>
Robin hesitates, as if to argue, then <<he>> nods.
<<if _robin.trauma gte 20>>
	<<He>> gives you one last look, then walks away.
<<else>>
	<<He>> gives you a reassuring smile, then walks away.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $brownFoxRevealed>>
	<<if $avery_mansion.fox.nobody>>
		Nobody sits down under a nearby tree, and continues to watch the mansion burn.
	<<else>>
		<<say_brown_fox "cap">> sits down under a nearby tree, and continues to watch the mansion burn.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

The goons climb into the other cars as Bailey climbs into <<person1>> <<hers>>. "Good work," <<he>> says. <<He>> sits behind the wheel as the others drive away. <<Hes>> in no rush.
<br><br>

<<link [["Ask why " + $NPCList[0].pronouns.he + " came " + $NPCList[0].pronouns.himself|Skyscraper Run Bailey Ask]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Remain silent|Skyscraper Run Bailey Silent]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey Ask
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 7: Ask
   PC asks why Bailey came in person. Meek / bratty / neutral variants.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"You... actually came," you say, "a-and you brought Robin."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"You actually came for me instead of sitting on your ass," you say, "and you brought Robin over too."
<<else>>
	"You came for me," you say, "and you brought Robin with you."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey's eyes meet yours briefly through the rearview mirror before <<he>> turns them back to the road. "Don't overthink it."

<<if !$wardrobe_residential_alleys>>
	<br><br>
	<<set $wardrobe_residential_alleys to 1>>
	"We moved your belongings to a storage unit near the orphanage," <<he>> says, handing you a key. "In the alleyways behind it. Number 22 is yours. Don't tell the others. They'll all want one."
<</if>>
<br><br>

Bailey starts the engine, and drives onto the boulevard.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Skyscraper Run Bailey 6]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey Silent
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 7: Silent
   PC says nothing. The wardrobe line is the same as vanilla.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
<<if !$wardrobe_residential_alleys>>
	<<set $wardrobe_residential_alleys to 1>>
	"We moved your belongings to a storage unit near the orphanage," Bailey says, handing you a key. "In the alleyways behind it. Number 22 is yours. Don't tell the others. They'll all want one."
<</if>>

Bailey starts the engine, and drives onto the boulevard.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Skyscraper Run Bailey 6]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Skyscraper Run Bailey 6
/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   SKYSCRAPER RUN (Stockholm variant) — Beat 8: Welcome home
   Same content as vanilla Run 6; kept as its own passage for clean routing.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
<<set $location to "town">><<set $bus to "domus">><<effects>>
<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>

Bailey drives to Domus Street, and stops outside the orphanage. <<He>> climbs out, waits for you to do likewise, then leads you into the building.
<br><br>

"Welcome home."<<npcincr Bailey love 3>><<set $bailey_love += 3>><<ggglove "Bailey">>
<br><br>
<<avery_antiques_end>>
<<link [[Next|Orphanage]]>><<endevent>><<unset $silenceNotifications>><</link>>
<br>
